    "lawCode": "Amd §343-k, Hway L",
    "lawSection": "Highway Law",
    "memo": "BILL NUMBER:S6321\n\nTITLE OF BILL:  An act to amend the highway law, in relation to the\n\"St. Lawrence Wine Trail\"\n\nPURPOSE:\n\nTo designate a portion of the state highway system in St Lawrence\nCounty as the \"St. Lawrence Wine Trail\".\n\nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 amends the heading of section 343-k of the Highway Law to\ninclude the \"St. Lawrence Wine Trail\" in the listing of wine trails.\nSection 1 also adds a new subdivision 10 to section 343k of the\nHighway Law to designate specific portions of the state highway system\nin St. Lawrence County as the \"St. Lawrence Wine Trail\".\n\nSection 2 provides that this act shall take effect immediately.\n\nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nCurrently, although wine trails already exist in many parts of the\nstate, none exist in St. Lawrence County. Therefore, this bill is\nnecessary to create the \"St. Lawrence Wine Trail\" along portions of\nthe state highway system in St. Lawrence County. Creation of this wine\ntrail will raise awareness of the wineries and vineyards in Saint\nLawrence County. It will shed a new and positive light on this part of\nthe region's economy.\n\nCreation of the St. Lawrence Wine Trail will also provide a new\nattraction for residents and visitors of the North Country. Although\nthis area already has much to offer, the \"St. Lawrence Wine Trail\"\nwill be a great addition to all the wonderful opportunities that\nalready exist. Visiting the wineries along the trail will become\nanother exciting activity for the visitors and residents of St.\nLawrence County and the entire North Country. Therefore, enactment of\nthis bill is necessary to create the \"St. Lawrence Wine Trail\".\n\nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew Bill.\n\nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nMinimal.\n\nEFFECTIVE DATE:\n\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n\n",
